# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent: its places are its caller's, in line order; its parameters bind as patterns do) and ch. 7 (a dynamic's readers move in the tick it moves): the plain tuple's names are values of the build, the bundle's event and dynamic are the caller's.
